饰处理的布衣，衣服的边缘处也添加了简单的纹饰。","en":"A cloth garment made from ordinary fabric and adorned with patterns, with simple trim also added along the edges."},"defenceVal":"2","mp":"340","price":"1200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1024505","name":{"zh":"立巾帻","en":"Upright Kerchief"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"与屋山帻一样，为最常见的巾帻，多为地方小官、传令官佩戴。","en":"Like the ridged cap, one of the most common headcloths, typically worn by minor officials and heralds."},"defenceVal":"5","mp":"1000","price":"5500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP1001015","name":{"zh":"汗血","en":"Sweatblood"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"西域进贡的纯种汗血宝马，皮肤薄，血管可见，冲刺时如流血汗。","en":"A purebred blood-sweating horse presented as tribute from the Western Regions, with thin skin and visible veins that appear to sweat blood at full gallop."},"price":"10000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{"family":{"label":{"zh":"亲属","en":"Relatives"},"people":[{"id":"WJ10377","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI110515","name":{"zh":"鲜卑轲比氏","en":"The Kebi clan of the Xianbei"},"years":["0","235"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，鲜卑为东胡别支。轲比能本为小种鲜卑，以勇健、执法公平被推举为大人。鲜卑首领轲比能，建安年间向曹操进贡，魏文帝封附义王。轲比能统一漠南，控弦十余万骑，屡犯魏边，为幽、并大患。青龙三年，幽州刺史王雄派刺客韩龙将其刺杀，鲜卑政权瓦解。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, of which the Xianbei were an offshoot. Kebineng originally hailed from a minor Xianbei branch and was chosen as chieftain for his martial valor and fair enforcement of laws. During the Jian'an era, the Xianbei chieftain Kebineng paid tribute to Cao Cao, and Emperor Wen of Wei enfeoffed him as the King of Fuyi. Kebineng unified the lands South of the Gobi, commanding over 100,000 mounted archers, and repeatedly raided Wei's borders, becoming a grave menace to You and Bing Provinces. In the third year of Qinglong, Wang Xiong, Inspector of You Province, sent the assassin Han Long to slay him, leading to the collapse of the Xianbei regime."},"talent":{"military":"9","commerce":"3","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"苴罗侯","height":"平均",