le":1,"rank":"1","loyalty":"100","reputation":"6600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10012","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1024505","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,71,44,37,61,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10012","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1024505","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10377","city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,71,44,37,61,63],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10012","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1024505","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"鲜卑贵族，轲比能之弟，随兄长参与鲜卑部族争霸。青龙年间，鲜卑大人步度根、泄归泥因与轲比能决裂，率三万余部归附曹魏雁门郡，魏将牵招命其反攻轲比能势力。苴罗侯作为轲比能阵营的核心成员，在双方混战中被步度根、泄归泥部击杀。","tc":"鮮卑貴族，軻比能之弟，隨兄長參與鮮卑部族爭霸。青龍年間，鮮卑大人步度根、泄歸泥因與軻比能決裂，率三萬余部歸附曹魏雁門郡，魏將牽招命其反攻軻比能勢力。苴羅侯作為軻比能陣營的核心成員，在雙方混戰中被步度根、泄歸泥部擊殺。","en":"A Xianbei noble and younger brother of Kebineng, who joined his brother in the struggle for supremacy among the Xianbei tribes. During the Qinglong era, the Xianbei chieftains Budugen and Xieguini broke with Kebineng and led over 30,000 followers to submit to Cao Wei at Yanmen Commandery. Wei general Qian Zhao ordered them to launch a counteroffensive against Kebineng's faction. Juluohou, as a core member of Kebineng's camp, was slain in the fighting by the forces of Budugen and Xieguini.","jp":"鮮卑の貴族。軻比能の弟。兄に従って鮮卑部族の覇権争いに加わった。青龍年間、鮮卑の大人の歩度根と泄帰泥が軻比能と決裂し、三万余の部族を率いて曹魏の雁門郡に帰順すると、魏将の牽招は彼らに軻比能勢力への反撃を命じた。苴羅侯は軻比能陣営の中核として戦ったが、両軍の混戦の中で歩度根と泄帰泥の軍勢に討ち取られた。","kr":"선비족 귀족이자 가비능의 아우로, 형을 따라 선비 부족의 패권 다툼에 참여했다. 청룡 연간, 선비 대인 보도근과 설귀니가 가비능과 결별하고 3만여 부락을 이끌고 조위의 안문군에 귀부하자, 위나라 장수 견초는 이들에게 가비능 세력을 반격하도록 명했다. 가비능 진영의 핵심 인물이었던 저라후는 양측의 혼전 속에서 보도근과 설귀니의 군세에 격살당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1044715","remark":"普武","surname":"","surnameTc":"","surnameEn":"","surnameJp":"","surnameKr":"","surnameOther":"","name":"苴罗侯","nameTc":"苴羅侯","nameEn":"Juluohou","nameJp":"苴羅侯","nameKr":"저라후","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"苴罗侯","power":"WJ10377","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"185","city":"CS1076","gender":"0","rule":"74","force":"71","wise":"44","politics":"37","charm":"61","will":"63","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"33/36/71/41/34/37/38/34","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1002201","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"8300","battleSoulPoint":"7300","debateSoulPoint":"5400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001005","professions":"2/3/3/3/0/0/2/0/0/0/3/2/2/1/2/0/1/1/0/0/0/4/3/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"32","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3400","evaluate":"-1300","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"173","show":"185","death":"235","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP10012","armor":"WP1013905","helmet":"WP1024505","treasure":"","horse":"WP1001015","shield":"","character":"0/2;1/2;19/1;33/1;3/1;28/2;30/2;9/2;13/1;43/0;22/1;10/1","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"WJ10377/100","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"鲜卑贵族，轲比能之弟，随兄长参与鲜卑部族争霸。青龙年间，鲜卑大人步度根、泄归泥因与轲比能决裂，率三万余部归附曹魏雁门郡，魏将牵招命其反攻轲比能势力。苴罗侯作为轲比能阵营的核心成员，在双方混